## 7. FORMAL CYBERNETIC & GAME-THEORETIC INVARIANTS

1. **Kademlia XOR & Dynamic Salvo Redundancy Quota ($K_k^*$) Allocation Invariant:**
   $$\forall V_k \in \mathcal{V}_{\text{Active}}, \quad \sum_{i=1}^N \mathbb{I}\left(\text{Assigned}(\text{Node}_i, V_k)\right) \le K_k^* = \left\lceil \frac{\ln(1 - P_{\text{req}}(V_k))}{\ln(1 - p_k)} \right\rceil \quad \land \quad \text{Tokens}_{\text{C2}} = 0$$

2. **Byzantine Kinematic State-Residual Partitioning Invariant:**
   $$N \ge 3f + 1 \;\land\; \left(\|\Delta \mathbf{v}_j\| / \Delta t > a_{\max}\right) \implies \text{Weight}_{\text{Quorum}}(\text{Node}_j) = 0$$

3. **QRNG Kalman-Filter Divergence Invariant:**
   $$\mathbf{u}_t = \mathbf{u}_{\text{Nominal}} + \mathcal{QRNG}[-a, a] \quad (\Delta U \le \epsilon) \implies \det(\mathbf{P}_{k|k-1}^{\text{Tracker}}) \to \infty$$

4. **Passive Curtilage Harm-Beacon & SfM Divergence Invariant:**
   $$\text{Alt}(\text{UAS}) < h_{\text{Curtilage}} \implies \text{Emit}(\text{HarmBeacon}_{\text{14CFR89}}) = 1 \;\land\; \nabla \mathcal{L}_{\text{SfM}}(\text{Moiré}) \to \text{Divergent}$$

5. **Jurisdiction-Bifurcated Adversarial Intrusion Gate (`Invariants 21, 22, & 30`):**
   $$\text{Jurisdiction} \in \{\text{US, EU, GB}\} \implies \text{Action}(\text{DarkUAS}) = \text{Passive\_TDoA\_Handoff} \land \text{ActiveInterdiction} = 0$$
   $$\text{Jurisdiction} = \text{CONFLICT\_ZONE} \land \text{Quorum}_{3f+1} \land \text{Token}_{\text{LOAC}} \implies \text{Allocate}\left(C_{\text{Marginal}} \le \mathbb{E}[L_{\text{Asset}}]\right) = 1$$

